OL,3,GNEWSANeuter your pets, says charity hit
OL,4,Aby cat 'crisis'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn animal rescue charity says it is
OL,7,Fstruggling to cope with a "crisis" in
OL,8,Funwanted cats due to falling rates of
OL,9,Fneutering.
OL,11,FMichele Franks, from Lincs Ark, said:
OL,12,F"We're seeing a big increase the number
OL,13,Fof phone calls from people saying, 'I
OL,14,Fhave a stray cat that has given birth
OL,15,Fin my garden'."
OL,17,FNeutering prevents reproduction, but
OL,18,Fresearch by Cats Protection suggests
OL,19,Fthe proportion of cats undergoing the
OL,20,Fprocedure fell from 88% in 2020 to 82%
OL,21,Fin 2025.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
