OL,3,GNEWSANeuter your pets, says charity hit
OL,4,Aby cat 'crisis'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMatthew Wright, head of operations at
OL,7,FRSPCA Hull and East Riding, said most
OL,8,Frescue charities struggled to pay for
OL,9,Fneutering, adding: "If people are
OL,10,Fabandoning cats and there are health
OL,11,Fissues with those cats, it's going to
OL,12,Fhave a knock-on effect."
